import lib/std.dl

class:
    patterns:
        [a|] point
    members:
        x
        y

a new point with x horizontal and y vertical means: @intrinsic("construct", a point, horizontal, vertical)

set sample to a new point with x 10 and y 20
print lines (the x of sample), sample's y and (the x of sample + the y of sample)

# Type cast tests
print lines (3.14 as an integer), (42 as a 16 bit integer), (7 as a byte) and (100 as a floating-point number)
